{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The What-fruit: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja54'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 54 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Āsīsavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hope </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>4. Kiṁphalajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The What-fruit: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nāyaṁ rukkho durāruho, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>This tree is not hard to climb, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>napi gāmato ārakā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>nor is it far from the village. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ākāraṇena jānāmi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>For this reason I know </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>nāyaṁ sāduphalo dumo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>this tree is not sweet-fruited. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Kiṁphalajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
